m 14:26 ( י ׳שְׁבֻעַת ᵐ5 ); keep, discharge the oath is הַשּׁ ׳הֵקִים Gen 26:3 (J), Jer 11:5 ; מִשׁ ׳נָקָה be free, exempt from an oath Gen 24:8 (J), compare Josh 2:17 , 20 . b. = curse , Isa 65:15 and (|| אָלָה ) Num 5:21 (P), Dan 9:11 . 2 oath of ׳י , in promise, Deut 7:8 ( שָׁמַר in rel. clause), || covenant ( בְּרִית ), לְיִצְחָק שְׁבוּעַתוֺ Psa 105:9 = 1Chr 16:16 . &#8212; מַטּוֺת שְׁבֻעוֺת Hab 3:9 very dubious: AV oaths of the tribes; oaths, rods of the word, Hi-St; sworn (passive participle שְׁבַע ) were the rods ( = chastisements) of (thy) word, Ges Hi RVm; heptads of spears Ew, compare Da; text probably corrupt, Now proposes (אַשְׁמָּֽתְךָׅ שִׂבַּעְתָּ thou hast sated with shafts thy quiver ; Marti (after ᵐ5 Manuscripts ) thy bow was satiated with shafts ; GASm thou gluttest (?) thy shafts . — Ezek 21:28 see √.","rootNote":"feminine passive participle of 7650 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 16 16","keyReferences":["1Chr 16 16","1Kgs 2 43","1Sam 14 26","2Chr 15 15","2Sam 21 7","Dan 9 11","Deut 7 8","Eccl 8 2"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":30,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 16 16","book":"1Chr","chapter":16,"verse":16,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/שְׁבוּעָת֖/וֹ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncfsc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"1Kgs 2 43","book":"1Kgs","chapter":2,"verse":43,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שְׁבֻעַ֣ת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc"},{"reference":"1Sam 14 26","book":"1Sam","chapter":14,"verse":26,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/שְּׁבֻעָֽה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncfsa"},{"reference":"2Chr 15 15","book":"2Chr","chapter":15,"verse":15,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/שְּׁבוּעָ֗ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncfsa"},{"reference":"2Sam 21 7","book":"2Sam","chapter":21,"verse":7,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שְׁבֻעַ֤ת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc"},{"reference":"Dan 9 11","book":"Dan","chapter":9,"verse":11,"eng